      "body": "Repro via a Card projector spanning a linebreak:\n\n```\nlet one_card\n= ^^card((Spades,Jack)) in\n```\n\nThe code text and its decorations (selection highlight, caret, error squiggles) land on different rows below the projector. Root cause: `Code.view` walks a tile's shards right-to-left while `Measured` walks left-to-right, desyncing a shared deferred-linebreak counter, so the code text fails to reserve the projector's rows. A fix exists (`Code.re` walk-order, `Aba.join` \u2192 `Aba.fold_left`) and is being folded into the drawer PR #2321. (Closing #2359 as a dup of this.)\n",
